WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.100
Make sure your cake is completely cool
before adding frosting.

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:07.880
Spread a thin layer gently across the top,

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:09.900
turning the plate as you work.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.980
Add a little more where needed,

00:00:15.150 --> 00:00:18.860
then finish with a simple swirl or a few
sprinkles.
